@base_url = http://localhost:8080/api

### GET All decks

### Bad Request missing Auth Header
GET {{base_url}}/decks/1 HTTP/1.1

### Good Request
GET {{base_url}}/decks/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: { "id": "1","email": "a@a.com"}

### GET One deck

### Happy Path
GET {{base_url}}/deck/1 HTTP/1.1

### Bad Path Deck Not Found
GET {{base_url}}/deck/999 HTTP/1.1